    {
        "content": "<p>Couple of additional follow-ups in topology. Want to make sure I'm doing this right by posting here and adhering to community standards.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/41665\">https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/41665</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/41663\">https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/41663</a></li>\n</ul>",
